Pictures in docs/
=================

The screenshots and figures in docs/ show frames of two open movies, and of clips made
from them with MiniMax H3 (frames altered by the model: restyled, edited or continued, as
each figure says):

   Sintel - (c) copyright Blender Foundation | durian.blender.org
   Tears of Steel - (CC) Blender Foundation | mango.blender.org

Both films are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Only the picture of Tears of Steel is
used; its soundtrack is not. The other pictures were generated with MiniMax H3 from text.


